            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 65,
              "start": 65
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kagan, justice Kagan raised concerns about the fluctuating funding status of plans across months."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e8ad065b81e81700654e9dfffc84c790ddf0c23fc9f38a0b425cff129dacf914",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-e8ad065b81e8-0003-0002"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 67,
              "start": 67
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "According to Justice Kavanaugh, justice Kavanaugh questioned whether a forward\u2011looking injury theory would mean a participant could never sue."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Alito",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e8ad065b81e81700654e9dfffc84c790ddf0c23fc9f38a0b425cff129dacf914",
            "evidence_ids": [
              "ev-e8ad065b81e8-0003-0005"
            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 71,
              "start": 71
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Alito asked whether Congress can label anything as property."
      }
