            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 23,
              "start": 23
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "The Court notes that beneficiaries have historically been able to sue trustees for breach of trust, a right that is expressed in ERISA."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Court",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "e8ad065b81e81700654e9dfffc84c790ddf0c23fc9f38a0b425cff129dacf914",
